        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Welcome, Player. Let me tell you a story… and let’s find out why this world is dead.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/3ff7ed5a581d3bc838eb14212f08f19e.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World Tales is a narrative puzzle roguelite in which each playthrough is a story—and every story is a clue to the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You delve into a universe fragmented by past decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You journey through dark fables and symbolic worlds using a tic‑tac‑toe–based puzzle system, reinvented with new mechanics and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each tale, you take on the role of a different character with their own dilemma: from sorcerers defying death to civilizations that have forgotten their purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering each character’s destiny doesn’t just determine their individual outcome—it also brings you closer to the truth behind the world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/7390ac571de946415d3da3320d2a9938.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic‑tac‑toe–based puzzles</strong>: strategic twists that represent narrative decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets</strong>: each level hides mysteries and easter‑eggs, some of which help you unveil the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and philosophical stories</strong>: self‑contained tales full of choices, symbols, and moral dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: the combination of levels and decisions lets you unlock secret levels and story conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Failure is not the end</strong>: failing a level doesn’t end your run; it offers an alternative story outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro visual style</strong>: art that evokes the era of PS2 games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the metanarrative</strong>: interpret the stories and connect their consequences to piece together the past and face the end.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Welcome, Player. Let me tell you a story… and let’s find out why this world is dead.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/3ff7ed5a581d3bc838eb14212f08f19e.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World Tales is a narrative puzzle roguelite in which each playthrough is a story—and every story is a clue to the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You delve into a universe fragmented by past decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You journey through dark fables and symbolic worlds using a tic‑tac‑toe–based puzzle system, reinvented with new mechanics and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each tale, you take on the role of a different character with their own dilemma: from sorcerers defying death to civilizations that have forgotten their purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering each character’s destiny doesn’t just determine their individual outcome—it also brings you closer to the truth behind the world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/7390ac571de946415d3da3320d2a9938.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic‑tac‑toe–based puzzles</strong>: strategic twists that represent narrative decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets</strong>: each level hides mysteries and easter‑eggs, some of which help you unveil the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and philosophical stories</strong>: self‑contained tales full of choices, symbols, and moral dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: the combination of levels and decisions lets you unlock secret levels and story conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Failure is not the end</strong>: failing a level doesn’t end your run; it offers an alternative story outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro visual style</strong>: art that evokes the era of PS2 games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the metanarrative</strong>: interpret the stories and connect their consequences to piece together the past and face the end.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A narrative roguelite puzzle game inspired by tic‑tac‑toe, where you explore self‑contained stories and make decisions that uncover the mystery of the world’s end.",
